<title>POLAND: INVESTORS BID FOR PLN 294 MLN POLISH FIXED BONDS.</title>
<headline>INVESTORS BID FOR PLN 294 MLN POLISH FIXED BONDS.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Investors bid for 277 million zlotys of Polish two-year 16-percent bonds and for 17 million zlotys of five-year 12-percent bonds against the treasury's joint 800 million zloty offer, the central bank said.</p>
<p>Results of the auction should be available later today.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
